{
    "title": "Mudflap",
    "description": "Truckers save big on diesel with the Mudflap app, recommended by 94% of drivers.\r\nMudflap users save up to $100 per fill-up, and get monthly rewards at a nationwide network of over 2,500 stops without minimum gallon requirements or waiting for rebates.\r\n\r\nThe Mudflap app is accepted nationwide at independent truck stops and regional chains including TA, Petro, Speedway, 7-11, Sapp Bros, Casey\u2019s, KwikTrip, AMBEST, Cubby\u2019s, Road Ranger, FastLane, Mach 1, Hutch\u2019s, Truck World, and more.\r\n\r\nTo get started simply:\r\n\u2022 Download our secure app.\r\n\u2022 Connect your debit card, bank account, or credit card.\r\n\u2022 Choose a truck stop from our network.\r\n\u2022 Use your unique fuel savings code for significant discounts.\r\n\r\nNo credit checks, waiting period, or hassle. Download Mudflap and start saving on fuel today!\r\n\r\n\u2014\r\n\r\nHave questions? Need help? We\u2019re here! The Mudflap customer support team is available around the clock to help you with any questions. Call us at 888-885-3835 or email us at support@mudflapinc.com anytime.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Truckers save big on diesel with the Mudflap app, recommended by 94% of drivers.<br>Mudflap users save up to $100 per fill-up, and get monthly rewards at a nationwide network of over 2,500 stops without minimum gallon requirements or waiting for rebates.<br><br>The Mudflap app is accepted nationwide at independent truck stops and regional chains including TA, Petro, Speedway, 7-11, Sapp Bros, Casey\u2019s, KwikTrip, AMBEST, Cubby\u2019s, Road Ranger, FastLane, Mach 1, Hutch\u2019s, Truck World, and more.<br><br>To get started simply:<br>\u2022 Download our secure app.<br>\u2022 Connect your debit card, bank account, or credit card.<br>\u2022 Choose a truck stop from our network.<br>\u2022 Use your unique fuel savings code for significant discounts.<br><br>No credit checks, waiting period, or hassle. Download Mudflap and start saving on fuel today!<br><br>\u2014<br><br>Have questions? Need help? We\u2019re here! The Mudflap customer support team is available around the clock to help you with any questions. Call us at 888-885-3835 or email us at support@mudflapinc.com anytime.",
